onate to help animals and other causes. <i>(Click our developer name, Scalisco, at the top of the page!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our wholesome community on Discord (check the links on the side of the page).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit  to see our corgi merch and mobile games that also help us donate to animal shelters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing!</p>", "short_description": "EmBARK on a therapeutic adventure alone or with a friend. Collect Corgi Butt Power to climb, soar, and prove stubby legs can't stop you! Relax and savor this bite-sized, open world while 10% of your purchase is donated to animal shelters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/b64e48358a4213ddd51688d460422b987feacc1b/header.jpg?t=1773616886", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/87c2a062a70ea826a5ee154b95aad6c6335746d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773616886", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/87c2a062a70ea826a5ee154b95aad6c6335746d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773616886", "website": "https://scalisco.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Only (for now)</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Scalisco"], "publishers": ["Scalisco"], "pri